# ==============================================================================
# self-hosted-llc .gitignore (Updated: Personal Info Protection)
# ==============================================================================

# --- OS / IDE ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/

# --- Personal Information Protection (Suffix Rule) ---
# ファイル名が "__self" で終わるすべてのファイルを、拡張子を問わず除外します
# 例: 01_articles_of_incorporation__self.md, seal_image__self.png
*__self.*
*__self

# --- Directories for Private Data ---
# 念のため、特定のディレクトリ配下もすべて除外対象としておきます
private/
secrets/
tmp/

# --- Media & Scanned Data ---
# 実印の印影、通帳コピー、身分証、マイナンバー関連
*.pdf
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
*.gif

# --- Document Software Temp Files ---
*.docx
*.doc
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.csv
.env
.env.local

# ==============================================================================
# Rule:
# 1. テンプレートやナレッジはそのままコミット。
# 2. 自分の情報を入力したファイルは、必ず末尾に "__self" を付与すること。
#    例: documents/01_articles_of_incorporation__self.md
# ==============================================================================